# Dress Down is on the battlefield before The Seriema enters. Eight charge counters turn on its 7+ striation: one static ability
# whose effect began in layer 4 (CR 721.2a-b), so its layer 6 part keeps applying although Dress Down, earlier in layer 6, took
# The Seriema's abilities (CR 613.6) - and that part gives it, after Dress Down, the static ability "Other tapped legendary
# creatures you control have indestructible" (CR 613.1f, 613.7a). The tapped Agent Maria Hill, whose own abilities Dress Down
# took, has indestructible.

